                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "With the needle\nfreed, OFF reads\nZERO. ON fills the\nbucket to TWO",
                                  "marks, and the\ngauge agrees. Dot\nsigns the test\nherself. Pip\noffers",
                                  "a gold star. She\naccepts a second\nwitness signature\ninstead, then",
                                  "asks for the star\nas well."
                                ],
